        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7012/0, Rectangular Satin Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Stainless Steel 5 Inch Flush Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It is for use on sliding pocket doors. The small, 3/32 inch projection ensures that it will fit in even the narrowest of pocket door gaps. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-5-inch-privacy-set-omnia-7012-l\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 5 Inch Modern Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7012-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Omnia 7012 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> one (1) rectangle flush pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
